              <Pad Id="JivsgUxWexKP8g5aiAJ2SS" Bounds="526,192,414,140" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="The default implementation should allow the user to opt-into transitions (not done for integers typically) and opt-out of transitions (if the type would allow one, but it doesn't make sense in your context).&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;We can feed the global channel path to the user and double check.">
